==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
A couple meatshields, a few damage dealers, and a [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitter]] are all you need.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
Near identical strategy, but bring a [[:Category:Cats with Warp Immunity|Immune to Warp]] and a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] for the Star Pengs and Ribbos.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Bring a [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitter]], 1 or 2 attackers and some meatshields and the level should be easy. Also bring a Cat [[:Category:Cats with Warp Immunity|Immune to Warp]] if dealing with the Corporal Weylands gets too hard.

